:AdjustPearlescentColourSubtract
CallNative PLAYER_PED_ID 0 1
CallNative IS_PED_SITTING_IN_ANY_VEHICLE 1 1
JumpFalse @EndClassicColours
GetStaticP 446
Call @StringToInt
JumpFalse @SetPearlescentColourValueToMax
GetStaticP 446
Call @StringToInt
Push 1
Sub
SetStatic 461
Call @ApplyPearlescentColour
Jump @EndClassicColours
:SetPearlescentColourValueToMax
Push 160
SetStatic 461
Call @ApplyPearlescentColour
Jump @EndClassicColours

:AdjustPearlescentColourAdd
