:ChangeWalkingType
Function 1 3
GetStatic 328
Push 2
JumpNE @ChangeWalkingTypeSkipCheck
Call @DoesPedExist
JumpFalse @EndChangeWalkingType2
:ChangeWalkingTypeSkipCheck
GetLocal 0
CallNative HAS_CLIP_SET_LOADED 1 1
Push 1
JumpEQ @ClipSetLoadedContinue
GetLocal 0
CallNative REQUEST_CLIP_SET 1 0
Call @MenuLoading
Jump @ChangeWalkingTypeSkipCheck
:ClipSetLoadedContinue
GetStatic 328
Push 2
JumpEQ @ChangeWalkingTypePed
CallNative PLAYER_PED_ID 0 1
Jump @ChangeWalkingTypeNow
:ChangeWalkingTypePed
Call @GetPedToManage
:ChangeWalkingTypeNow
GetLocal 0
PushF 1
CallNative SET_PED_MOVEMENT_CLIPSET 3 0
GetLocal 0
CallNative REMOVE_CLIP_SET 1 0
GetStatic 328
Push 2
JumpNE @EndChangeWalkingType2
PushString "Changed walking style."
Push 1
Call @DrawNotification
:EndChangeWalkingType2
Return 1 0

