Push 30
CallNative CLEAR_BIT 2 0
Jump @WorldOptionsReturn
:TurnOnDisableSounds
GetStaticP 15
Push 30
CallNative SET_BIT 2 0
Jump @WorldOptionsReturn

:WorldOptionsMaxTrafficSpeed
GetStatic 15
Push 28
CallNative IS_BIT_SET 2 1
JumpFalse @TurnOnMaxTrafficSpeed
GetStatic 674
CallNative _0x0C0332A6 1 1
Drop
GetStaticP 15
Push 28
CallNative CLEAR_BIT 2 0
Jump @WorldOptionsReturn
:TurnOnMaxTrafficSpeed
GetStaticP 15
Push 28
CallNative SET_BIT 2 0
Jump @WorldOptionsReturn

:WorldOptionsCameraZoom
GetStatic 9
Push 7
CallNative IS_BIT_SET 2 1
JumpFalse @TurnOnCameraZoom
GetStaticP 9
Push 7
CallNative CLEAR_BIT 2 0
Jump @WorldOptionsReturn
:TurnOnCameraZoom
GetStaticP 9
Push 7
CallNative SET_BIT 2 0
Jump @WorldOptionsReturn

:WorldOptionsResetWavesIntensity
CallNative _0x4AD23212 0 0
Jump @WorldOptionsReturn

:WorldOptionsReturn
Return 0 0

