:IndicatorLightsSubMenu
Function 0 2
Push 3
Call @DrawBackground
PushString "Indicator Lights"
Call @AddMenuTitle
PushString "Binds"
GetStatic 15
Push 31
CallNative IS_BIT_SET 2 1
Call @AddBoolOption
PushString "Left"
GetStatic 546
Call @GetVehicleModValue
Push 1
Push 0
Push 0
Call @AddRightSidedOption
PushString "Right"
GetStatic 547
Call @GetVehicleModValue
Push 1
Push 0
Push 0
Call @AddRightSidedOption
Call @GetCurrentOption
Push 1
JumpEQ @IndicatorLightBindsInfo
Push 0
SetStatic 336
Call @CheckLeftPressed
Push 1
JumpEQ @AdjustIndicatorValueSub
Call @CheckRightPressed
Push 1
JumpEQ @AdjustIndicatorValueAdd
Jump @IndicatorLightsOptions

:IndicatorLightBindsInfo
CallNative IS_PS3_VERSION 0 1
JumpFalse @IndicatorLightBindsInfoXBOX
PushString "Hold L1"
Jump @IndicatorLightBindsInfoContinue
:IndicatorLightBindsInfoXBOX
PushString "Hold LB"
:IndicatorLightBindsInfoContinue
PushString "& press D-pad Left/Right to toggle the left/right indicator."
Call @AddInfo2Strings
Jump @IndicatorLightsOptions

:AdjustIndicatorValueSub
Call @GetCurrentOption
Switch [2 @AdjustLeftIndicatorSub][3 @AdjustRightIndicatorSub]

:AdjustLeftIndicatorSub
GetStatic 546
JumpFalse @SetLeftIndicatorToMax
Push 0
SetStatic 546
Jump @IndicatorLightsOptions
:SetLeftIndicatorToMax
Push 1
SetStatic 546
Jump @IndicatorLightsOptions

:AdjustRightIndicatorSub
GetStatic 547
JumpFalse @SetRightIndicatorToMax
Push 0
SetStatic 547
Jump @IndicatorLightsOptions
:SetRightIndicatorToMax
Push 1
SetStatic 547
Jump @IndicatorLightsOptions

:AdjustIndicatorValueAdd
Call @GetCurrentOption
Switch [2 @AdjustLeftIndicatorAdd][3 @AdjustRightIndicatorAdd]

:AdjustLeftIndicatorAdd
GetStatic 546
Push 1
JumpEQ @SetLeftIndicatorToMin
Push 1
SetStatic 546
Jump @IndicatorLightsOptions
:SetLeftIndicatorToMin
Push 0
SetStatic 546
Jump @IndicatorLightsOptions

:AdjustRightIndicatorAdd
GetStatic 547
Push 1
JumpEQ @SetRightIndicatorToMin
Push 1
SetStatic 547
Jump @IndicatorLightsOptions
:SetRightIndicatorToMin
Push 0
SetStatic 547
Jump @IndicatorLightsOptions

:IndicatorLightsOptions
Call @CheckAPressed
JumpFalse @EndIndicatorLights
Call @GetCurrentOption
Switch [1 @IndicatorLightsToggleBinds][2 @IndicatorLightsLeft][3 @IndicatorLightsRight]

:IndicatorLightsToggleBinds
GetStatic 15
Push 31
CallNative IS_BIT_SET 2 1
JumpFalse @TurnOnIndicatorLightBinds
GetStaticP 15
Push 31
CallNative CLEAR_BIT 2 0
Jump @EndIndicatorLights
:TurnOnIndicatorLightBinds
GetStaticP 15
Push 31
CallNative SET_BIT 2 0
Jump @EndIndicatorLights

:IndicatorLightsLeft
CallNative PLAYER_PED_ID 0 1
CallNative IS_PED_SITTING_IN_ANY_VEHICLE 1 1
JumpFalse @EndIndicatorLights
CallNative PLAYER_PED_ID 0 1
CallNative GET_VEHICLE_PED_IS_USING 1 1
Push 1
GetStatic 546
CallNative SET_VEHICLE_INDICATOR_LIGHTS 3 0
Jump @EndIndicatorLights

:IndicatorLightsRight
CallNative PLAYER_PED_ID 0 1
CallNative IS_PED_SITTING_IN_ANY_VEHICLE 1 1
JumpFalse @EndIndicatorLights
CallNative PLAYER_PED_ID 0 1
CallNative GET_VEHICLE_PED_IS_USING 1 1
Push 0
GetStatic 547
CallNative SET_VEHICLE_INDICATOR_LIGHTS 3 0
Jump @EndIndicatorLights

:EndIndicatorLights
Return 0 0

