JumpFalse @TurnOnParticleFX
GetStaticP 13
GetStatic 597
CallNative CLEAR_BIT 2 0
Jump @EndOnlinePlayerParticleFXOptions
:TurnOnParticleFX
Push 10
SetStatic 608
GetStaticP 13
GetStatic 597
CallNative SET_BIT 2 0
Jump @EndOnlinePlayerParticleFXOptions

