Push @OnlinePlayerParticleFXTypesSubMenu
Call @ChangeSubmenu
Push 1
SetStatic 201
Jump @EndOnlinePlayerParticleFXOptions

:EndOnlinePlayerParticleFXOptions
Return 0 0

