:AutodriveToggle
GetStatic 16
Push 3
CallNative IS_BIT_SET 2 1
JumpFalse @TurnOnAutodrive
CallNative PLAYER_PED_ID 0 1
CallNative CLEAR_PED_TASKS 1 0
GetStatic 686
CallNative REMOVE_VEHICLE_UPSIDEDOWN_CHECK 1 0
GetStaticP 16
Push 3
CallNative CLEAR_BIT 2 0
Jump @EndAutodrive
:TurnOnAutodrive
CallNative PLAYER_PED_ID 0 1
CallNative IS_PED_SITTING_IN_ANY_VEHICLE 1 1
JumpFalse @EndAutodrive
CallNative PLAYER_PED_ID 0 1
CallNative GET_VEHICLE_PED_IS_USING 1 1
Dup
SetStatic 686
Push -1
CallNative GET_PED_IN_VEHICLE_SEAT 2 1
CallNative PLAYER_PED_ID 0 1
JumpNE @EndAutodrive
GetStatic 686
Push 0
CallNative IS_VEHICLE_DRIVEABLE 2 1
JumpFalse @EndAutodrive
GetStatic 686
CallNative GET_ENTITY_MODEL 1 1
CallNative IS_THIS_MODEL_A_PLANE 1 1
GetStatic 686
CallNative GET_ENTITY_MODEL 1 1
CallNative IS_THIS_MODEL_A_HELI 1 1
Or
Push 1
JumpEQ @AutodriveVehicleError
GetStatic 686
CallNative GET_ENTITY_MODEL 1 1
CallNative IS_THIS_MODEL_A_BOAT 1 1
JumpFalse @TurnOnAutodriveSkipWaterCheck
GetStatic 686
CallNative IS_ENTITY_IN_WATER 1 1
JumpFalse @AutodriveBoatError
:TurnOnAutodriveSkipWaterCheck
CallNative IS_WAYPOINT_ACTIVE 0 1
JumpFalse @AutodriveWaypointError
GetStatic 686
CallNative ADD_VEHICLE_UPSIDEDOWN_CHECK 1 0
PushF 0
PushF 0
PushF 0
Push 3
GetStaticP 688
FromStack
CallNative PLAYER_PED_ID 0 1
PushF 1
CallNative SET_DRIVER_ABILITY 2 0
GetStaticP 16
Push 3
CallNative SET_BIT 2 0
Jump @EndAutodrive
:AutodriveVehicleError
PushString "Not available with Planes or Helicopters."
Push 0
Call @DrawNotification
Jump @EndAutodrive
:AutodriveBoatError
PushString "The boat you are using is not in water."
Push 0
Call @DrawNotification
Jump @EndAutodrive
:AutodriveWaypointError
PushString "Please set a waypoint first."
Push 0
Call @DrawNotification
Jump @EndAutodrive

:EndAutodrive
Return 0 0